frac{2\\pi n}{5}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo, we have that $a=\\frac{7\\pi }{30}.$" 13194139534157 true] [17592186279324 1000 #edb/ref 17592186279325 13194139534157 true] [17592186279324 1000 #edb/ref 17592186279326 13194139534157 true] [17592186279324 1000 #edb/ref 17592186279327 13194139534157 true] [17592186279324 1000 #edb/ref 17592186279328 13194139534157 true] [17592186279324 1000 #edb/ref 17592186279329 13194139534157 true] [17592186279324 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139534157 true] [17592186279324 1041 "selection" 13194139534157 true] [17592186279324 1104 #edb/ref 17592186279327 13194139534157 true] [17592186279324 1110 #uuid "ecd6b3ae-8526-5334-a9aa-490618f27f79" 13194139534157 true] [17592186279325 1034 "\\frac{5\\pi }{6}" 13194139534157 true] [17592186279325 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534157 true] [17592186279325 1111 #uuid "f531d1ab-646b-50c9-9dd6-64907eef1f71" 13194139534157 true] [17592186279326 1034 "\\frac{6\\pi }{5}" 13194139534157 true] [17592186279326 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534157 true] [17592186279326 1111 #uuid "2df6e8df-3e7e-50d4-9019-054f1b4765b3" 13194139534157 true] [17592186279327 1034 "\\frac{7\\pi }{30}" 13194139534157 true] [17592186279327 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534157 true] [17592186279327 1111 #uuid "0096e992-63ab-5731-ab9a-4ae0e332eeb2" 13194139534157 true] [17592186279328 1034 "\\frac{7\\pi }{6}" 13194139534157 true] [17592186279328 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534157 true] [17592186279328 1111 #uuid "d3932372-9171-5f70-8c8f-316868ba95c4" 13194139534157 true] [17592186279329 1034 "\\frac{\\pi }{5}" 13194139534157 true] [17592186279329 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534157 true] [17592186279329 1111 #uuid "4e899ce5-e583-53a1-827e-7429bf319bfc" 13194139534157 true] [17592186279330 1017 #edb/ref 17592186279331 13194139534157 true] [17592186279330 1089 "q-16252" 13194139534157 true] [17592186279330 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045463 13194139534157 true] [17592186279330 1100 "Consider the f